# Keep host-built artifacts out of the image so the build runs fresh inside it.
# libtiff-src/ is configured per-platform (macOS host vs Linux image), so it
# must be re-fetched/re-configured by `make deps` in the container.
.git
libtiff-src
tiff-*.tar.xz
build
tiff2pdf/c/tiff2pdf.c
t2p-test/tifs
t2p-test/pdfs
.DS_Store
._*
